MoonWaker embedded TV keyboard attribution
===========================================

app/src/main/java/com/limelight/console/EmbeddedTvKeyboardView.java was written for
MoonWaker. Its controller-navigation and wide-key layout concepts were independently
implemented with reference to the Android Open Source Project (AOSP) LeanbackIME:

  LeanbackKeyboardView.java
  blob 45d52e825cf7ca99e1a01522abb1f865eea252ec
  https://android.googlesource.com/platform/packages/inputmethods/LeanbackIME/+/45d52e825cf7ca99e1a01522abb1f865eea252ec/src/com/android/inputmethod/leanback/LeanbackKeyboardView.java

